<title>SOUTH AFRICA: LYDEX YR SHR DIPS, NO DIV.</title>
<headline>LYDEX YR SHR DIPS, NO DIV.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     24.8     vs   26.7 loss</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    3.54    vs    3.68 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    4.19    vs    3.69</p>
<p>    Tax			  0.65    vs    0.01</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    5.66    vs    3.86</p>
<p>    Revenue		   16.84    vs   18.03</p>
<p>Accumulated loss at</p>
<p>    end of year	     38.61    vs   42.16</p>
<p>Full name: Lydenburg Exploration Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The revenue resulting from the sale of slimes</p>
<p>material is lower than in 1995 due to declining gold head grades</p>
<p>of slimes being processed in the current year. The 1995</p>
<p>exploration and operating expenditure include a write down of</p>
<p>mineral rights of 10.5 million rand. No similar write down was</p>
<p>required in the current year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
